<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="organization" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name>Imagine Dragons</ttm:name></ttm:agent><amll:meta key="musicName" value="I’m So Sorry"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Smoke + Mirrors (Deluxe)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="“梦龙” LOOM TOUR 2026 中国巡演特别版"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="30621332"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1879820931"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:37.360"><div begin="34.000" end="47.350" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="34.000" end="40.060" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.000" end="34.540">About</span> <span begin="34.540" end="35.230">time</span> <span begin="35.230" end="35.560">for</span> <span begin="35.560" end="36.280">anyone</span> <span begin="36.280" end="36.730">telling</span> <span begin="36.730" end="37.180">you</span> <span begin="37.180" end="37.450">off</span> <span begin="37.450" end="38.110">for</span> <span begin="38.110" end="38.230">all</span> <span begin="38.230" end="38.380">your</span> <span begin="38.380" end="40.060">deeds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早该有人为你的所作所为斥责你了</span></p><p begin="40.720" end="47.350" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.720" end="41.110">No</span> <span begin="41.110" end="41.980">sign,</span> <span begin="41.980" end="42.130">the</span> <span begin="42.130" end="42.970">roaring</span> <span begin="42.970" end="43.660">thunder</span> <span begin="43.660" end="44.320">stopped</span> <span begin="44.320" end="44.470">in</span> <span begin="44.470" end="44.980">cold</span> <span begin="44.980" end="45.100">to</span> <span begin="45.100" end="45.850">read</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫无征兆，咆哮的雷声在彻骨寒意中骤停，仿佛要读懂什么</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="45.850" end="47.350"><span begin="45.850" end="46.210">(No</span> <span begin="46.210" end="47.350">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没时间了</span></span></p></div><div begin="47.380" end="59.230" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="47.380" end="53.920" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.380" end="47.590">I</span> <span begin="47.590" end="47.920">get</span> <span begin="47.920" end="48.700">mine</span> <span begin="48.700" end="48.820">and</span> <span begin="48.820" end="49.180">make</span> <span begin="49.180" end="49.540">no</span> <span begin="49.540" end="50.500">excuses</span> <span begin="50.530" end="51.010">waste</span> <span begin="51.010" end="51.190">of</span> <span begin="51.190" end="51.790">precious</span> <span begin="51.790" end="52.570">breath</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我争取属于我的一切，不找借口，别浪费宝贵的气息</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="52.600" end="53.920"><span begin="52.600" end="52.960">(No</span> <span begin="52.960" end="53.920">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没时间了</span></span></p><p begin="54.100" end="56.500" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.100" end="54.280">The</span> <span begin="54.280" end="54.640">sun</span> <span begin="54.640" end="55.480">shines</span> <span begin="55.480" end="55.690">on</span> <span begin="55.690" end="56.500">everyone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光照耀着每一个人</span></p><p begin="56.500" end="59.230" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.500" end="57.250">Everyone,</span> <span begin="57.250" end="57.670">love</span> <span begin="57.670" end="58.330">yourself</span> <span begin="58.330" end="58.480">to</span> <span begin="58.480" end="59.230">death</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人，都要爱自己爱到死</span></p></div><div begin="59.230" end="1:14.140" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="59.230" end="1:02.920" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.230" end="59.530">So</span> <span begin="59.530" end="59.710">you</span> <span begin="59.710" end="1:00.130">gotta</span> <span begin="1:00.130" end="1:00.640">fire</span> <span begin="1:00.640" end="1:01.330">up,</span> <span begin="1:01.330" end="1:01.480">you</span> <span begin="1:01.480" end="1:01.900">gotta</span> <span begin="1:01.900" end="1:02.290">let</span> <span begin="1:02.290" end="1:02.920">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以你得燃起来，也得学会放手</span></p><p begin="1:02.920" end="1:06.190" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.920" end="1:03.190">You&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:03.190" end="1:03.520">never</span> <span begin="1:03.520" end="1:03.850">be</span> <span begin="1:03.850" end="1:04.360">loved</span> <span begin="1:04.360" end="1:04.840">&apos;til</span> <span begin="1:04.840" end="1:04.930">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:04.930" end="1:05.200">made</span> <span begin="1:05.200" end="1:05.770">your</span> <span begin="1:05.770" end="1:06.190">own</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在闯出自己的路之前，你永远得不到爱</span></p><p begin="1:06.310" end="1:09.610" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.310" end="1:06.490">You</span> <span begin="1:06.490" end="1:06.850">gotta</span> <span begin="1:06.850" end="1:07.420">face</span> <span begin="1:07.420" end="1:07.990">up,</span> <span begin="1:07.990" end="1:08.200">you</span> <span begin="1:08.200" end="1:08.590">gotta</span> <span begin="1:08.590" end="1:08.920">get</span> <span begin="1:08.920" end="1:09.610">yours</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你得直面现实，去拿回属于你的</span></p><p begin="1:09.640" end="1:14.140" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.640" end="1:09.880">You</span> <span begin="1:09.880" end="1:10.240">never</span> <span begin="1:10.240" end="1:10.510">know</span> <span begin="1:10.510" end="1:10.660">the</span> <span begin="1:10.660" end="1:11.050">top</span> <span begin="1:11.050" end="1:11.350">&apos;til</span> <span begin="1:11.350" end="1:11.530">you</span> <span begin="1:11.530" end="1:11.920">get</span> <span begin="1:11.920" end="1:12.310">too</span> <span begin="1:12.310" end="1:14.140">low</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有跌入过谷底，你就不会懂得何为巅峰</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.320" end="1:27.760" itunes:songPart="PostChorus"><p begin="1:14.320" end="1:17.710" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.320" end="1:14.710">A</span> <span begin="1:14.710" end="1:15.250">son</span> <span begin="1:15.250" end="1:15.430">of</span> <span begin="1:15.430" end="1:16.000">a</span> <span begin="1:16.000" end="1:17.710">stepfather</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继父的儿子</span></p><p begin="1:17.740" end="1:20.890" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.740" end="1:18.100">A</span> <span begin="1:18.100" end="1:18.610">son</span> <span begin="1:18.610" end="1:18.710">of</span> <span begin="1:18.710" end="1:18.820">a—,</span> <span begin="1:18.820" end="1:19.450">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:19.450" end="1:19.810">so</span> <span begin="1:19.810" end="1:20.890">sorry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个狗娘养的—，我真的很抱歉</span></p><p begin="1:21.100" end="1:24.430" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.100" end="1:21.460">A</span> <span begin="1:21.460" end="1:21.970">son</span> <span begin="1:21.970" end="1:22.180">of</span> <span begin="1:22.180" end="1:22.690">a</span> <span begin="1:22.720" end="1:24.430">stepfather</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继父的儿子</span></p><p begin="1:24.490" end="1:27.760" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.490" end="1:24.820">A</span> <span begin="1:24.820" end="1:25.360">son</span> <span begin="1:25.360" end="1:25.460">of</span> <span begin="1:25.460" end="1:25.510">a—,</span> <span begin="1:25.510" end="1:26.080">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:26.080" end="1:26.530">so</span> <span begin="1:26.530" end="1:27.760">sorry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个狗娘养的—，我真的很抱歉</span></p></div><div begin="1:27.790" end="1:41.140" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:27.790" end="1:30.850" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.790" end="1:28.270">No</span> <span begin="1:28.270" end="1:29.080">lies</span> <span begin="1:29.080" end="1:29.200">and</span> <span begin="1:29.200" end="1:29.620">no</span> <span begin="1:29.620" end="1:30.850">deceiving</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有谎言，也没有欺骗</span></p><p begin="1:30.850" end="1:33.430" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.850" end="1:31.330">Man</span> <span begin="1:31.330" end="1:31.510">is</span> <span begin="1:31.510" end="1:31.810">what</span> <span begin="1:31.810" end="1:32.050">he</span> <span begin="1:32.050" end="1:33.430">loves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人由其所爱定义</span></p><p begin="1:34.480" end="1:41.140" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.480" end="1:34.600">I</span> <span begin="1:34.600" end="1:34.990">keep</span> <span begin="1:34.990" end="1:35.860">tryin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:35.860" end="1:36.280">to</span> <span begin="1:36.280" end="1:37.210">conceive</span> <span begin="1:37.210" end="1:37.570">that</span> <span begin="1:37.570" end="1:38.080">death</span> <span begin="1:38.080" end="1:38.260">is</span> <span begin="1:38.260" end="1:38.590">from</span> <span begin="1:38.590" end="1:39.610">above</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直试着相信，死亡源自上苍</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:39.610" end="1:41.140"><span begin="1:39.610" end="1:40.000">(No</span> <span begin="1:40.000" end="1:41.140">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没时间了</span></span></p></div><div begin="1:41.170" end="1:53.020" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:41.170" end="1:47.710" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1